明"}},{"title":"黄仲高先辈枉访有赠 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"四明才子气如虹，何事低头王长公。\n误道姓名登琬琰，此身原只在墙东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42883,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题复甫墨牡丹 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"百种沈香亭畔枝，锦嫣红醉午风迟。\n那期虢国夫人到，淡扫春山八字眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42884,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题复甫墨牡丹 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"半幅生绡墨乍匀，天然貌出玉精神。\n朱栏下尽葳蕤锁，却是丹青解误人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42885,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏山人自张司马归云辱倒屣之延而所谋未尽果戏赠一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"博得侯门一笑新，鬓霜犹自未回春。\n人间不遇邢和璞，谁向天门礼弄臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42886,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题潇湘夜雨有感","author":"王世贞","text":"扁舟十载问潇湘，曾向天东指雁行。\n今夜对床春梦稳，不妨风雨过西堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42887,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"作张令书戏题后","author":"王世贞","text":"贪闻方外有闲居，笔砚垂抛乐有余。\n谁信别生方外事，为僧仍作使君书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42888,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙师处见徐郎有赠","author":"王